    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n8982" root="حلى" body-key="H">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">حَالٍ</span></b>  (K) and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">حَالِيَةٌ</span> (S, K) A woman <i>having
an ornament or ornaments;</i> (S, K;) as also ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">حَلِيَّةٌ</span></b> :
(S:) or <i>wearing an ornament</i> or <i>ornaments;</i> as
also ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مُتَحَلِّيَةٌ</span></b> : (K:) pl. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">حَوَالٍ</span>. (S.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  And
[hence,] <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">حَالِيَةٌ</span> means (tropical:)  Trees <i>having leaves and
fruit.</i> (TA.)

